\newlabel{flower-nat-pgd-rar-ig-diff-lens}{{8}{7}{For Flower dataset, average top-$k$ intersection, $1$-LENS-prec@$k$, $1$-LENS-recall@$k$ measured between IG(original image) and IG(perturbed image) for models that are naturally trained, PGD-trained and IG-SUM-NORM trained. The perturbation used is the top-$t$ attack of \citep  {ghorbani2018interpretation}. Note top-$k$ is equivalent to $0$-LENS-prec@$k$, $0$-LENS-recall@$k$.}{}{}}
